  · exact (high_gamma_expanded_of_compact .k186 _ compact_ok).trans expanded_ok
  · apply high_gamma_profile_int_of_den 84 40 _ _ rfl _ base_num_ok
    exact (high_gamma_den_of_row 40 _ den_row_ok).trans denLCM
  · change
      Array.ofFn
